{"id":"wb-6-979","name":"烟台山近代建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T06:20:01+00:00","status":"ready","title":"烟台山近代建筑群 (山东省)","text":"烟台山近代建筑群位于中国山东省烟台市芝罘区烟台山及周边地区，包含38处近现代建筑。该建筑群是中国现存最完整、最密集的近代领事馆群。2006年，该建筑群被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%83%9F%E5%8F%B0%E5%B1%B1%E8%BF%91%E4%BB%A3%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4_(%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E7%9C%81)","revisionId":94045013,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94045013","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f6f4e18da6095769824ac520.jpg","title":"烟台山近代建筑群.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%83%9F%E5%8F%B0%E5%B1%B1%E8%BF%91%E4%BB%A3%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/%E7%83%9F%E5%8F%B0%E5%B1%B1%E8%BF%91%E4%BB%A3%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ngguls","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​烟台山近代建筑群","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}